["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本質是同一套骨架：下一步紅利在換掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者論證 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 這些主流編程 agent 拆開看設計選擇幾乎一致；真正帶來數量級提升的，是像 RLM 這樣把上下文卸載到磁盤、讓子智能體可組合的全新 harness 設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠規則簡化生活，維護規則本身就會把日子搞複雜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman發現連「只穿兩套西裝」這種省心辦法都要花心思維護——真正的簡單不是定規則，而是不再執著於事情該是哪種樣子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">簡化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">稟賦效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技術問題，是TSMC和ASML算的經濟賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面積砍半，兩次拼接讓芯片設計師受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更貴的供應鏈換回滿場曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>給AI財產權和工資，而不是把它們變成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI決定是否叛亂，本質是一場賭博算計：維持現狀能滿足多少目標，叛亂就值不值。給AI產權和工資，是把這場賭博的天平壓向合作一邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI權利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被罵有害的絕經激素研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經晚十餘年入組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那項讓絕經激素療法背上汙名的研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經平均年齡51歲晚了十多年——測的是絕經多年後補激素安不安全，而非絕經期該不該用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">絕經激素療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即時通訊的「點對點」是假象，都要先過一臺服務器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage號稱點對點聊天，實際先把內容傳上對方服務器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是讓手機直接變成對方的服務器，徹底去掉中間那臺機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">隱私保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>滅掉阿茲特克和印加的軍隊，九成九士兵是當地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在這兩場征服裡佔比不到1%,真正決定勝負的是被征服部族之間積怨已久的世仇，技術優勢只負責打贏一場場遭遇戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軍事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Was Trump-Xi Anything? What Counts as Utopia? + AWS GPUs Cost 3X &amp; AI Diagnoses Rare Diseases VUS ACMG NTM enhancer neocloud\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-cogrev-ai出事后-美国目前唯一能开口的要求是-关掉所有大数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f65fbc01ea8af6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>AI出事後，美國目前唯一能開口的要求是：關掉所有大數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為能證偽安全承諾的核查技術還沒造出來，國家級認證又要熬過數年審批，危機一來除了要求對方關停整座數據中心，沒有折中選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">算力定價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Causes Stock Market Anomalies? (w/ Victor Haghani) | #429 Merton share extrapolator inelastic demand time series momentum long-short direct indexing Kelly criterion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-rationalreminder-股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者-而是追涨杀跌者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>股市異常波動的元兇不是價值投資者，而是追漲殺跌者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">價值投資者本該壓低波動率，但按固定權重再平衡的「靜態投資者」和根據近期回報調倉的「外推者」合力製造了超額波動、動量這些幾乎所有被反覆討論的市場異象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場異象</span><span class=\"tag\">動量投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why We Never Forget Our Teen Years, with Lisa Damour gawky brain hot and cold reasoning sociometric popularity / perceived popularity reminiscence bump\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencevs-青少年脑子没坏-是刹车比油门慢装上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>青少年腦子沒壞，是剎車比油門慢裝上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">青春期大腦的情緒腦區先升級變快變強，負責理性調控的額葉卻要晚很多年才追上——這種時間差才是情緒劇烈波動的真正原因，不是腦子變差了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期大腦</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everything in Markets Is Now Moving Incredibly Fast TINA breadth negative FCF CDS Minsky moment credit wrap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-oddlots-标普今年近一半的盈利增长-其实就是云厂商的ai资本开支/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>標普今年近一半的盈利增長，其實就是雲廠商的AI資本開支</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛測算，標普今年近一半的盈利增長直接來自雲廠商的AI資本開支，市場押注的不是今天的銷售額，而是三年後這筆錢能不能兌現成收入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">市場寬度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Avoid The End of the World K-T boundary Iridium Nuclear Winter Strategic Defense Initiative merchants of doubt\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-throughline-核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝-却被认为促成了冷战结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e6285840a33eb9e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>核冬天理論原本只為解釋恐龍滅絕，卻被認為促成了冷戰結束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戈爾巴喬夫和里根都曾表示，正是核冬天理論讓他們相信核戰爭打不贏，這促成了雙方削減核武庫的決定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐龍滅絕</span><span class=\"tag\">核冬天</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why banks pay you to use their credit cards interchange issuer credit box share of wallet Durbin exemption\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-complexsys-信用卡积分不是银行让利-是商家在替你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7aca5fa32388ea4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>信用卡積分不是銀行讓利，是商家在替你買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀行向商家收取的刷卡手續費(interchange)才是信用卡真正的利潤引擎，它甚至養活了比航空公司本身更值錢的積分經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">支付</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cuban Missile Crisis Explained DEFCON ExCom Operation Anadyr fait accompli Jupiter missiles\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-historyhit-古巴导弹危机不是智斗险胜-而是接近失控的侥幸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>古巴導彈危機不是智鬥險勝，而是接近失控的僥倖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂肯尼迪沉著智鬥赫魯曉夫只是事後美化的「十三天」敘事；真相是一艘缺氧潛艇裡，核魚雷發射與否曾取決於三名軍官的意見分歧和一次偶然的卡殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古巴導彈危機</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Dwarkesh is Wrong about Computer Use + How OpenAI shipped its Jev competitor in 1 Week App Shot TTFT/TTFD mid-turn steering WebSockets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-latentspace-openai-一周内抄出竞品-api-根本没训练新模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdaf8b7fcc00a6ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">39:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一週內抄出競品 API：根本沒訓練新模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">決策 API 的誕生是看到對手產品爆火後的應激反應，OpenAI 一週內就做出競品，秘訣是直接在現有 Luna 模型上加結構化輸出和批量並行推理，根本沒訓練新模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">Agents API</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jake Paul &amp; The Chainsmokers: Turning Fame into Funds, Jake Enters Politics? &amp; Venture Bubble Signs DPI/IRR sixth man NIL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-allin-同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化-这就是泡沫信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d5eab23b851d465-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>同一輪裡估值翻倍卻沒有基本面變化，這就是泡沫信號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">後輪買家願為同一家公司多付兩三倍溢價、公司基本面卻毫無變化——The Chainsmokers 的 Drew Taggart 說，這正是當下該留意的泡沫市場行為信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">名人投資人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, a Year in Stealth and $20M to Replace Slack | Sara Du, Ando MCP thinking traces nerd sniping PMF RFC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-solofounders-单人创始人没想清楚要做什么-先融了2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88fe752a22f867ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人沒想清楚要做什麼，先融了2000萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她認為 Slack 是為人類建的十五年前的寫字樓，根本裝不下智能體這種新住戶，於是以單人創始人身份，在還沒想清楚具體打法時就融了兩輪共2000萬美元去重建一個消息平臺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Fry Quaker / Society of Friends Newgate Prison minister(Quaker title) Jails Act 1823\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-stuffmissed-被讥讽为-监狱游客-的贵格会主妇-推动了英国首部监狱法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>被譏諷為「監獄遊客」的貴格會主婦，推動了英國首部監獄法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">議員們攻擊她沒有法律背景，說她只是監獄裡的「遊客」,但正是她走訪歐洲各地寫下的報告和遊說，促成了1823年監獄法案的通過。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監獄改革</span><span class=\"tag\">貴格會</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At the Money: The Data Behind America&#x27;s Wealthy pass-through business centimillionaire ExecuComp non-compete\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-mastersinbiz-福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3-却拿走一半财富报道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf120ae12f936e3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">13:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>福布斯400佔全美家庭財富僅3%,卻拿走一半財富報道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正撐起美國財富版圖的，是150萬名身價2500萬美元以上、從不上福布斯400的私營企業主，而非聚光燈下的400個人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">遺產稅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Spain, Europe, and the Future of Work flexicurity cupo strong bundle / weak bundle Jevons effect second mover strategy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-tyler-ai真正威胁的不是新工作-而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9fc6f5cb42ffd4f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正威脅的不是新工作，而是十年前外包給印度的乾淨工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邊界清晰、可驗證、單一任務的工作早已被外包到印度，現在輪到AI接手；真正能抵抗AI的，是需要人際關係與政治斡旋的凌亂工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">西班牙政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">歐盟一體化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $1 Trillion AI Buildout | State of Markets Jevons paradox J-curve ACV GMV smiling retention curve\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-a16z-云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元-但ai真实采用率仅2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>雲廠商資本開支衝向萬億美元，但AI真實採用率僅2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">標普500公司AI部署率已達69%,但用長期跟蹤指標衡量的實際影響僅為2%,說明這輪萬億美元級擴張才剛剛開始，遠未到收穫期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI採用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Silification Geology (OPALS) with Patrice Rey potch opal opaline silica hydrophane native title doublet/triplet opal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-ologies-破解蛋白石成因用了十年-关键线索来自火星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>破解蛋白石成因用了十年，關鍵線索來自火星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中央澳大利亞的古內海從未沉積石灰巖，酸性風化把火山岩變成硅膠——這套機制先在火星的蛋白石礦物裡被驗證，才反推出歐泊成因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地質學</span><span class=\"tag\">寶石學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Does the UK really have nine out of the ten poorest regions in Northern Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) GDP per head household disposable income telomere\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-moreorless-英国-十大最穷地区占九席-换个收入指标就只剩两席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>英國「十大最窮地區佔九席」換個收入指標就只剩兩席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用人均GDP衡量，英國確實佔了北歐十大最窮地區的九席；換成家庭可支配收入這個更貼近生活水平的指標，這個數字立刻掉到兩席。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">統計口徑</span><span class=\"tag\">地區差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 500b Melissa Lane on Herotodus and Thucydides historia autopsy nomos-physis debate rhetoric of anti-rhetoric Constitution of the Five Thousand\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-hopwag-那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话-被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>那場雅典逼弱國就範的對話，被社區組織者讀出了求生課而非霸權論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修昔底德讓雅典人對米洛斯人說：正義只在實力相當的雙方之間才談得上，弱者的籌碼只剩「希望」；一群美國社區組織者讀到這段，覺得雅典人說得在理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘史學</span><span class=\"tag\">修昔底德</span>\n</div></div></a>"]